# Testing

See `docs/TESTING.md`.

## MUST

- Cover happy and sad paths for changed behavior
- Mock `@anthropic-ai/sdk` for Claude unit tests
- Keep tests isolated and fast
- Preserve ≥ 80% Jest coverage thresholds

## MUST NOT

- Delete tests to make CI green
- Assert on third-party internals
- Leave failing suites
